sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Shell as Shell (App.tsx)
  participant Portfolio as CyberPortfolio
  participant Scope as cyberScope (useCyberScope)
  participant Data as cyberData selectors
  participant MemberHome as CyberMemberScreens

  User->>Shell: navigate to /cyber/portfolio
  Shell->>Scope: useCyberScope() role check
  Scope-->>Shell: role = HealthPRO Program Lead
  Shell->>Portfolio: render CyberPortfolio
  Portfolio->>Data: loadPortfolioMembers()
  Data-->>Portfolio: members, tiers, grades, metrics (fixtures)
  Portfolio->>Data: computeKpiStrip(members)
  Data-->>Portfolio: enrolled, avgGrade, openP1P2, slaMetPct, remediationPct
  Portfolio->>Data: computeGradeDistributionAndTierMix(members, filters)
  Data-->>Portfolio: distribution, tierMix
  Portfolio->>Data: computeAttentionList(members)
  Data-->>Portfolio: rankedRows with reason
  Portfolio->>Data: computeProvinceGroups(members)
  Data-->>Portfolio: provinceGroups with grade colour
  Portfolio->>Data: computeFacilityTypeMedianBenchmark(members, facilityType)
  Data-->>Portfolio: medianMetrics
  Portfolio-->>User: render KPI strip, filterable chart, attention list, province view, benchmark panel, AI-generated illustrative summary
  User->>Portfolio: change facility type / province filter
  Portfolio->>Data: computeGradeDistributionAndTierMix(members, newFilters)
  Data-->>Portfolio: updated distribution, tierMix
  Portfolio-->>User: re-render chart only
  User->>Portfolio: click member row in attention list
  Portfolio->>Scope: setViewAs(memberId, {readOnly:true})
  Scope-->>Portfolio: ack
  Portfolio->>MemberHome: navigate(/cyber/members/:memberId)
  MemberHome->>Scope: useCyberScope() reads viewAs flag
  Scope-->>MemberHome: readOnly=true, memberId
  MemberHome-->>User: render member home, mutating actions disabled, banner shows read-only view-as state
